         <particDesc>
            <p>A person called <persName ref="people:CIr008">Xwarēn</persName> gives the good scribe 15 dōlag of wine.</p>
            <p>The document is sealed by <persName ref="people:CIr001" type="seal">Frāy</persName>.</p>
