   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl" facs="berkeley:recid:85244-30.recto_ii.jpg/full/full/0/default.jpg"/>
            <ab xml:id="MP0030_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/><persName ref="people:CIr008">ḥwlynˈ</persName> MN ẔK Y ʿL bwnˈ ZNH
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>BYRḤ ʾmwrdṭ Y ŠNṬ 40-4-4
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>lwcyk lʾd ḤS 10-5 dwlkˈ
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>ʿL ḥwp SPLʾ YḤBWNṭˈ ckˈ
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/><persName ref="people:CIr001" type="seal">plʾd</persName> ḤṬYMWNṭ
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0030_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/><persName ref="people:CIr008">Xwarēn</persName> az ān ī ō bun ēn
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>māh Amurdād ī sāl 48
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>rōzīg rāy may 15 dōlag
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>ō xūb dibīr dād cak
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/><persName ref="people:CIr001" type="seal">Frāy</persName> āwišt
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="fr">
            <ab xml:id="MP0030_trans-p1"><persName ref="people:CIr008">Xwarēn</persName>, à partir de ce qui (est) dans le patrimoine, ce mois dʾAmurdād de lˈan 48, pour la ration, a remis quinze cruches de vin au bon scribe. <persName ref="people:CIr001" type="seal">Frāy</persName> a scellé le document.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>